  "releaseNotes": "Added automatic font resolution from platform registrations:\n- MAUI: reports can use fonts registered with ConfigureFonts by alias.\n- Uno: fonts declared with UnoFont are available by family name and matching style.\n- Explicit AddFont registrations retain priority.\nFixed cross-assembly font cache leakage and duplicate embedded font resources in Uno. Updated documentation and added MAUI and Uno examples.",
